(4983597, 726735, 97225, '<td valign="top">It is a bit of a stretch to see these as pajamas.</td>', 'It is a bit of a stretch to see these as pajamas.', '2008-10-01 03:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983602, 725275, 97225, '<td valign="top">Not this girl. That is the stuff of nightmares. Well done.</td>', 'Not this girl. That is the stuff of nightmares. Well done.', '2008-10-01 03:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983604, 726642, 97225, '<td valign="top">Cool.</td>', 'Cool.', '2008-10-01 03:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983606, 726639, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. I like her expression. The lighting is excellent and the floating feathers top it all off.</td>', 'Lovely shot. I like her expression. The lighting is excellent and the floating feathers top it all off.', '2008-10-01 03:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983610, 726876, 97225, '<td valign="top">I think the blown out white takes a bit away from this.</td>', 'I think the blown out white takes a bit away from this.', '2008-10-01 03:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983611, 727142, 97225, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot.</td>', 'Sweet shot.', '2008-10-01 03:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983613, 727007, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely expression. Nice composition. Maybe with a better focus, particularly on the eyes, this would be a really great shot.</td>', 'Lovely expression. Nice composition. Maybe with a better focus, particularly on the eyes, this would be a really great shot.', '2008-10-01 04:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983617, 726066, 97225, '<td valign="top">That is a lovely shot. I think I would like it even more if the focus didn''t soften so much on the father''s right eye. ( left in picture )</td>', 'That is a lovely shot. I think I would like it even more if the focus didn''t soften so much on the father''s right eye. ( left in picture )', '2008-10-01 04:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983619, 727204, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.</td>', 'Lovely shot.', '2008-10-01 04:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983620, 725370, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait. It almost looks like he is floating.</td>', 'Lovely portrait. It almost looks like he is floating.', '2008-10-01 04:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983621, 724894, 97225, '<td valign="top">The light is pretty harsh. ( to wake him up? )</td>', 'The light is pretty harsh. ( to wake him up? )', '2008-10-01 04:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983623, 727205, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice progression.</td>', 'Nice progression.', '2008-10-01 04:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983626, 726533, 97225, '<td valign="top">Maybe he needs a shoehorn to get into those? Great shot. I love his expression.</td>', 'Maybe he needs a shoehorn to get into those? Great shot. I love his expression.', '2008-10-01 04:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983629, 725317, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Beautiful child. I love the focus on his eyes.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Beautiful child. I love the focus on his eyes.', '2008-10-01 04:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983630, 726763, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2008-10-01 04:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983631, 726783, 97225, '<td valign="top">I like the pattern of repeats.</td>', 'I like the pattern of repeats.', '2008-10-01 04:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983633, 725505, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.</td>', 'Lovely shot.', '2008-10-01 04:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983635, 726663, 97225, '<td valign="top">A tantrum! Yes! Pajamas and tantrums are  SO together.</td>', 'A tantrum! Yes! Pajamas and tantrums are  SO together.', '2008-10-01 04:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983636, 727059, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. The teddy is a nice touch.</td>', 'Lovely shot. The teddy is a nice touch.', '2008-10-01 04:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983637, 727002, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.</td>', 'Lovely shot.', '2008-10-01 04:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983638, 725198, 97225, '<td valign="top">Gosh! He is a newbie. All the best to everyone.</td>', 'Gosh! He is a newbie. All the best to everyone.', '2008-10-01 04:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983639, 726963, 97225, '<td valign="top">Brilliant use of color.</td>', 'Brilliant use of color.', '2008-10-01 04:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983641, 726973, 96881, '<td valign="top">Clever Idea, and one that stands out.  Ofset gives the photo more here (instead of being just a frame seperated into shapes) so works well.  Slight uneveness of the light also seems to work, however the bottom left seems a little washed out (faded) looking as a result.</td>', 'Clever Idea, and one that stands out.  Ofset gives the photo more here (instead of being just a frame seperated into shapes) so works well.  Slight uneveness of the light also seems to work, however the bottom left seems a little washed out (faded) looking as a result.', '2008-10-01 04:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983643, 727041, 97225, '<td valign="top">That is effective. Maybe cropping it to eliminate the distracting bit of white on the bedding would improve it. You would still have enough.</td>', 'That is effective. Maybe cropping it to eliminate the distracting bit of white on the bedding would improve it. You would still have enough.', '2008-10-01 04:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983644, 725086, 96881, '<td valign="top">Would prefer you to use maximum available width to make viewing photo easier.  Photo looks out of focus here.</td>', 'Would prefer you to use maximum available width to make viewing photo easier.  Photo looks out of focus here.', '2008-10-01 04:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983647, 724664, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great combination of frog leap and frog pjs.</td>', 'Great combination of frog leap and frog pjs.', '2008-10-01 04:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983650, 727154, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.', '2008-10-01 04:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983651, 726783, 96881, '<td valign="top">Interesting pattern made here which makes for an interesting photo.  Great use of colour as well.<br/>I would have been tempted to mismatch all the PJ''s in this, therefore having non matching top/pants on each line.</td>', 'Interesting pattern made here which makes for an interesting photo.  Great use of colour as well.I would have been tempted to mismatch all the PJ''s in this, therefore having non matching top/pants on each line.', '2008-10-01 04:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983652, 725894, 97225, '<td valign="top">Cute dog, nice photo.</td>', 'Cute dog, nice photo.', '2008-10-01 04:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983653, 724894, 96881, '<td valign="top">Overexposed area on the sheet, although there for the effect of the sun shinning through the window, is a little overdone and distracting for me.  Photo looks noisy, skin tones don''t look right to me, she is very orange, and the clashing colours also put me off.  Pink?orange/Yellow/Brown all together I don''t think has worked.</td>', 'Overexposed area on the sheet, although there for the effect of the sun shinning through the window, is a little overdone and distracting for me.  Photo looks noisy, skin tones don''t look right to me, she is very orange, and the clashing colours also put me off.  Pink?orange/Yellow/Brown all together I don''t think has worked.', '2008-10-01 04:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983655, 726711, 97225, '<td valign="top">That''s an interesting presentation.</td>', 'That''s an interesting presentation.', '2008-10-01 04:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983656, 726504, 96881, '<td valign="top">Well put together, Depth of field is spot on IMO.  Lighhting looks great, colours work, Nothing I can suggests here.</td>', 'Well put together, Depth of field is spot on IMO.  Lighhting looks great, colours work, Nothing I can suggests here.', '2008-10-01 04:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983658, 725853, 96881, '<td valign="top">Very busy.  The orange dominates the shot.  The lack of light on the eyes etc, whien compared to the lower face doesn''t work fo me</td>', 'Very busy.  The orange dominates the shot.  The lack of light on the eyes etc, whien compared to the lower face doesn''t work fo me', '2008-10-01 04:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983659, 726957, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.', '2008-10-01 04:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983661, 726723, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. The building lines are a bit of a distraction.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. The building lines are a bit of a distraction.', '2008-10-01 04:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983663, 725505, 96881, '<td valign="top">Wish I had those PJ''s when I was young.......<br/>A different background, other than grey, may have worked better as the outfit is grey and therefore blends a little (and gives a very grey shot).  I like the yellow shoes tieing in with the yellow in the top.  The cape seems a little noisy though</td>', 'Wish I had those PJ''s when I was young.......A different background, other than grey, may have worked better as the outfit is grey and therefore blends a little (and gives a very grey shot).  I like the yellow shoes tieing in with the yellow in the top.  The cape seems a little noisy though', '2008-10-01 04:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983665, 726973, 97225, '<td valign="top">That is quite unique. It is very effective.</td>', 'That is quite unique. It is very effective.', '2008-10-01 04:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983666, 726774, 97225, '<td valign="top">Hahaha. LOL.</td>', 'Hahaha. LOL.', '2008-10-01 04:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983667, 726993, 97225, '<td valign="top">What an expression. Great.</td>', 'What an expression. Great.', '2008-10-01 04:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983668, 726763, 96881, '<td valign="top">Maybe these are your pj''s, but then again, could be any random material<br/>Ignoring that<br/>I don''t like the overexposed star in the foreground.  It attracts attention and takes away from the rest.  I do like the fading off into the distance of the stars, using both Depth of Field and lighting to achieve that.</td>', 'Maybe these are your pj''s, but then again, could be any random materialIgnoring thatI don''t like the overexposed star in the foreground.  It attracts attention and takes away from the rest.  I do like the fading off into the distance of the stars, using both Depth of Field and lighting to achieve that.', '2008-10-01 04:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983766, 727040, 77149, '<td valign="top">Dodgy! Glad I don''t have a "zoom-in" option on this site!  ;)  Nice photo too - the exposure came out pretty well</td>', 'Dodgy! Glad I don''t have a "zoom-in" option on this site!  ;)  Nice photo too - the exposure came out pretty well', '2008-10-01 05:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983769, 724660, 77149, '<td valign="top">Nothing like a willing model, hey? :)</td>', 'Nothing like a willing model, hey? :)', '2008-10-01 05:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
