(4983792, 727205, 77149, '<td valign="top">I just love the setting. Jealousy - that''s what it is  :)</td>', 'I just love the setting. Jealousy - that''s what it is  :)', '2008-10-01 05:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983869, 726973, 25355, '<td valign="top">Good idea! From the thumbnail, I thought this might be a Top Ten at least, but there''s something funky about the processing that might drag the score down a wee bit.</td>', 'Good idea! From the thumbnail, I thought this might be a Top Ten at least, but there''s something funky about the processing that might drag the score down a wee bit.', '2008-10-01 07:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983877, 724660, 25355, '<td valign="top">Well, you should get extra points for getting the rose to stay in her mouth - or maybe it didn''t stay there, and that''s why there''s a bit of nasal blur.<br/>   Also, very ironic come-on line from a doggie who doesn''t look very seductive, really. ;-Þ</td>', 'Well, you should get extra points for getting the rose to stay in her mouth - or maybe it didn''t stay there, and that''s why there''s a bit of nasal blur.   Also, very ironic come-on line from a doggie who doesn''t look very seductive, really. ;-Þ', '2008-10-01 07:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983881, 727204, 25355, '<td valign="top">She doesn''t need an alarm clock - she''ll wake up when the tide comes in. ;-Þ</td>', 'She doesn''t need an alarm clock - she''ll wake up when the tide comes in. ;-Þ', '2008-10-01 07:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983971, 727154, 73942, '<td valign="top">I bet there''s a lot of noise in this house.  Adorable boys!</td>', 'I bet there''s a lot of noise in this house.  Adorable boys!', '2008-10-01 08:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4983976, 726026, 94265, '<td valign="top">Instant 10, what a brilliant idea! Great lighting.</td>', 'Instant 10, what a brilliant idea! Great lighting.', '2008-10-01 08:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984157, 726642, 91298, '<td valign="top">You Rock MY world! -10</td>', 'You Rock MY world! -10', '2008-10-01 10:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984158, 725369, 91298, '<td valign="top">Very sweet. 7</td>', 'Very sweet. 7', '2008-10-01 10:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984210, 724660, 89468, '<td valign="top">Irresistable ! Ha ha!</td>', 'Irresistable ! Ha ha!', '2008-10-01 10:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984302, 725505, 70375, '<td valign="top">Your pose and attention to the pajamas is wonderful! Very nicely lit. Very nice catchlights. Nice depth. This image only has 1 thing that is lacking. Contrast. Your colours seem a hair washed out. Otherwise, wonderfully done!</td>', 'Your pose and attention to the pajamas is wonderful! Very nicely lit. Very nice catchlights. Nice depth. This image only has 1 thing that is lacking. Contrast. Your colours seem a hair washed out. Otherwise, wonderfully done!', '2008-10-01 10:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984319, 726533, 70375, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but your photo is lacking in focus and PJs. A higher f-stop might have been the way to go here. Of course, it could have been shutter speed. Try setting the camera on a railing or other stable surface for anything below 1/60s. However, your light is great and your exposure is nice.</td>', 'Nice concept, but your photo is lacking in focus and PJs. A higher f-stop might have been the way to go here. Of course, it could have been shutter speed. Try setting the camera on a railing or other stable surface for anything below 1/60s. However, your light is great and your exposure is nice.', '2008-10-01 10:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984320, 725198, 98489, '<td valign="top">cute</td>', 'cute', '2008-10-01 11:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984324, 726877, 98489, '<td valign="top">i loveee this</td>', 'i loveee this', '2008-10-01 11:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984331, 726565, 70375, '<td valign="top">Your concept is good. I like the idea that your PJ bottoms have left you and are taking a stroll. I would like to see the whole of the bottoms but I do understand that you had to attach them to something somewhere. :) I lament the lost foot, it makes the image feel a bit cramped. I''d like to see more of the whole scene. Overall, nicely done.</td>', 'Your concept is good. I like the idea that your PJ bottoms have left you and are taking a stroll. I would like to see the whole of the bottoms but I do understand that you had to attach them to something somewhere. :) I lament the lost foot, it makes the image feel a bit cramped. I''d like to see more of the whole scene. Overall, nicely done.', '2008-10-01 11:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984355, 727006, 39679, '<td valign="top">I''m always impressed when a photographer can deal with an intimate or erotic idea in such a subtle way.<br/> <br/>Having your subjects just out of focus really lends a sense of intimacy without making the scene too overt.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I''m always impressed when a photographer can deal with an intimate or erotic idea in such a subtle way. Having your subjects just out of focus really lends a sense of intimacy without making the scene too overt.  Nicely done.', '2008-10-01 11:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984358, 726743, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely composed shot but I''d really like to see the little boy be more in focus rather than the flames.</td>', 'This is a nicely composed shot but I''d really like to see the little boy be more in focus rather than the flames.', '2008-10-01 11:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984364, 725198, 70375, '<td valign="top">I see where you are going with this, but the execution of the idea might need some tweaking. Your focus is a tad soft. Try USM in photoshop or using a higher f-stop. The PJs are not the subject of this image, the feet are. Perhaps a full body shot would have been better for a PJs challenge. Your colour is off. A little to the yellow side. WB to tungsten or fluorescent indoors depending on what kind of lights you are under. This looks tungsten, fluorescent would be bluer.</td>', 'I see where you are going with this, but the execution of the idea might need some tweaking. Your focus is a tad soft. Try USM in photoshop or using a higher f-stop. The PJs are not the subject of this image, the feet are. Perhaps a full body shot would have been better for a PJs challenge. Your colour is off. A little to the yellow side. WB to tungsten or fluorescent indoors depending on what kind of lights you are under. This looks tungsten, fluorescent would be bluer.', '2008-10-01 11:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984366, 724894, 70375, '<td valign="top">Cute PJs :) Your colour seems to be a bit off (yellow). WB to tungsten in this situation. You also have quite a bit of noise (grain) in the photo. A lower ISO can fix this. Try to shoot everything indoors at ISO 100 when possible. You will get less noise. :)</td>', 'Cute PJs :) Your colour seems to be a bit off (yellow). WB to tungsten in this situation. You also have quite a bit of noise (grain) in the photo. A lower ISO can fix this. Try to shoot everything indoors at ISO 100 when possible. You will get less noise. :)', '2008-10-01 11:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984368, 726938, 39679, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Your subject contrasts so well  and in so many ways, with the background and really stands out.  I also really like the feeling of forward movement in having the road stretched out before her leading towards the distant horizon.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Your subject contrasts so well  and in so many ways, with the background and really stands out.  I also really like the feeling of forward movement in having the road stretched out before her leading towards the distant horizon.', '2008-10-01 11:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984375, 726877, 55956, '<td valign="top">good image.</td>', 'good image.', '2008-10-01 11:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984389, 727141, 39679, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why but this shot is kind of scary to me (it''s a good thing).  Perhaps being at such an unfamiliar point of view.</td>', 'I''m not sure why but this shot is kind of scary to me (it''s a good thing).  Perhaps being at such an unfamiliar point of view.', '2008-10-01 11:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984392, 725369, 55956, '<td valign="top">as personal opinion I weld more space on the top</td>', 'as personal opinion I weld more space on the top', '2008-10-01 11:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984397, 726548, 55956, '<td valign="top">good idea the pajamas facing upwards</td>', 'good idea the pajamas facing upwards', '2008-10-01 11:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984412, 726631, 65234, '<td valign="top">Quite a pessimistic vision.  Her pj''s contrast starkly against the fall tones.  I think I might have cropped tighter on the left and bottom so we would see her expression better.</td>', 'Quite a pessimistic vision.  Her pj''s contrast starkly against the fall tones.  I think I might have cropped tighter on the left and bottom so we would see her expression better.', '2008-10-01 11:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984415, 726720, 98171, '<td valign="top">LOL</td>', 'LOL', '2008-10-01 11:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984418, 726066, 98171, '<td valign="top">the resemblance is striking. I like this photo. Very nice.</td>', 'the resemblance is striking. I like this photo. Very nice.', '2008-10-01 11:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984420, 726931, 98171, '<td valign="top">I can identify with this. I curse getting up at 5:30 and taking the dogs out. I love the lighting in this photo. Very nice.</td>', 'I can identify with this. I curse getting up at 5:30 and taking the dogs out. I love the lighting in this photo. Very nice.', '2008-10-01 11:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984421, 725894, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aw, very cute!  I''d crop tighter, or shoot from a slightly higher angle, or pull the comforter over the pillows to simplify the background.</td>', 'Aw, very cute!  I''d crop tighter, or shoot from a slightly higher angle, or pull the comforter over the pillows to simplify the background.', '2008-10-01 11:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984423, 727002, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute concept and execution, but why is she wearing cat pajamas if she''s a wolf-child?  j/k.  Don''t know if it would have been possible to get a light above her but she could use a bit more on the top of her head and face.</td>', 'Cute concept and execution, but why is she wearing cat pajamas if she''s a wolf-child?  j/k.  Don''t know if it would have been possible to get a light above her but she could use a bit more on the top of her head and face.', '2008-10-01 11:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984427, 726877, 65234, '<td valign="top">Those pj''s look so out of place!  Can''t quite put my finger on why, maybe the shine?  Looks like a marvelous place, though; well sorth dreaming about.</td>', 'Those pj''s look so out of place!  Can''t quite put my finger on why, maybe the shine?  Looks like a marvelous place, though; well sorth dreaming about.', '2008-10-01 11:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984432, 727129, 65234, '<td valign="top">Geez, not sure I could sleep in such a bright color!  Cute idea to hang them up.  Think I might have done with more DOF or sharpened more as parts of this look soft (OK idea for the bear but dosan''t work for me on the pj''s).</td>', 'Geez, not sure I could sleep in such a bright color!  Cute idea to hang them up.  Think I might have done with more DOF or sharpened more as parts of this look soft (OK idea for the bear but dosan''t work for me on the pj''s).', '2008-10-01 11:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984434, 727204, 70375, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape. This is what I would dream of :) I do wish there were more of the PJs as the subject. As it stands now, the landscape commands most of the attention. Since it is aesthetically pleasing and the focus is good, it keeps the interest though. Nice job.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape. This is what I would dream of :) I do wish there were more of the PJs as the subject. As it stands now, the landscape commands most of the attention. Since it is aesthetically pleasing and the focus is good, it keeps the interest though. Nice job.', '2008-10-01 11:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984435, 727141, 65234, '<td valign="top">My girls always loved fuzzy slippers, especially critter-shaped ones.  Come to think of it, my 24 y.o. still wears cow slippers ;-)  I think the shot needed a bit more DOF to get the pink fuzzy slippers in sharper focus.</td>', 'My girls always loved fuzzy slippers, especially critter-shaped ones.  Come to think of it, my 24 y.o. still wears cow slippers ;-)  I think the shot needed a bit more DOF to get the pink fuzzy slippers in sharper focus.', '2008-10-01 11:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984441, 726947, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oops.  Like the idea and your models look like they had fun.  Because the older girl is looking up I feel like there should be more room on top of the shot, or the girls'' expressions should be reversed to make it feel more in balance.  Shot is very bright (I assume you needed to do that to make the background less visible) which is making it feel a little flat.</td>', 'Oops.  Like the idea and your models look like they had fun.  Because the older girl is looking up I feel like there should be more room on top of the shot, or the girls'' expressions should be reversed to make it feel more in balance.  Shot is very bright (I assume you needed to do that to make the background less visible) which is making it feel a little flat.', '2008-10-01 11:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984442, 725369, 65234, '<td valign="top">What a neat old-fashioned outfit!  Goes nicely with the quilted pillowcase.  Might like a litrle more light on her face but overall nicely done.</td>', 'What a neat old-fashioned outfit!  Goes nicely with the quilted pillowcase.  Might like a litrle more light on her face but overall nicely done.', '2008-10-01 11:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984444, 727205, 72782, '<td valign="top">Fun Concept.  I would have liked it better without the Shadows and Mountains, perhaps changing the angle a little could have uncluttered the background a little.</td>', 'Fun Concept.  I would have liked it better without the Shadows and Mountains, perhaps changing the angle a little could have uncluttered the background a little.', '2008-10-01 11:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984448, 724660, 98171, '<td valign="top">very funny</td>', 'very funny', '2008-10-01 11:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984450, 726978, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between the pj''s and the green, and I like the perspective adn DOF.  Line drying isn''t so common anymore but it does (usually) result in a nice, fresh scent :-)</td>', 'Nice contrast between the pj''s and the green, and I like the perspective adn DOF.  Line drying isn''t so common anymore but it does (usually) result in a nice, fresh scent :-)', '2008-10-01 11:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984451, 726923, 70375, '<td valign="top">I love the title. Winnie the Pooh is awesome. Here are the points that I feel are good: Your colour. Very nicely done. Your light. Good job on the natural vignette at the top of the image. The inclusion of the doll. It really gives some depth to the image. Things that could be improved upon: The top is cut off on the right. A wider shot would have been better. The PJ bottoms. Where are they? How do we know this isn''t just a T-Shirt? Overall, a good job.</td>', 'I love the title. Winnie the Pooh is awesome. Here are the points that I feel are good: Your colour. Very nicely done. Your light. Good job on the natural vignette at the top of the image. The inclusion of the doll. It really gives some depth to the image. Things that could be improved upon: The top is cut off on the right. A wider shot would have been better. The PJ bottoms. Where are they? How do we know this isn''t just a T-Shirt? Overall, a good job.', '2008-10-01 11:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984455, 727119, 65234, '<td valign="top">Good idea for the challenge and I like the pose.  Focus seems to be sharper on the cabinets in the back than on the model.</td>', 'Good idea for the challenge and I like the pose.  Focus seems to be sharper on the cabinets in the back than on the model.', '2008-10-01 11:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4984459, 726817, 72782, '<td valign="top">Fun Stuff.  Very Creative</td>', 'Fun Stuff.  Very Creative', '2008-10-01 11:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
