(4984464, 726994, 98171, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the pants and the wall. Overall, a very nice photo.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the pants and the wall. Overall, a very nice photo.', '2008-10-01 11:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
