(4984497, 726066, 65234, '<td valign="top">Sweet moment :-)  Focus looks like it''s sharp only on one of dad''s eyes, when I would expect it to be sharp on both of their faces.  Also a lot going on in the background even though it''s OOF; this might have been a stronger shot with a less cluttered background.</td>', 'Sweet moment :-)  Focus looks like it''s sharp only on one of dad''s eyes, when I would expect it to be sharp on both of their faces.  Also a lot going on in the background even though it''s OOF; this might have been a stronger shot with a less cluttered background.', '2008-10-01 12:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
