(4985477, 726763, 98023, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I feel this could be any material.</td>', 'Sorry, but I feel this could be any material.', '2008-10-01 18:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4985479, 725894, 98023, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture.</td>', 'Very nice picture.', '2008-10-01 18:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4985493, 726334, 70375, '<td valign="top">I am totally missing the point... are these the dog''s PJs that you are talking about? Or is the dog rolling in its mistresses PJs? I can see what look like boxers and a dog''s head... but it''s not coming together for me. I like the tones and the focus on the dog''s eyes is great. I would like to see the PJs take more of a center-stage roll. :)</td>', 'I am totally missing the point... are these the dog''s PJs that you are talking about? Or is the dog rolling in its mistresses PJs? I can see what look like boxers and a dog''s head... but it''s not coming together for me. I like the tones and the focus on the dog''s eyes is great. I would like to see the PJs take more of a center-stage roll. :)', '2008-10-01 18:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4985494, 726631, 70375, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand your title at all. I am guessing it means we are looking at the dreaming person? BUT, the PJs are very nice and your whole scene conveys an idea, which I really love. Her PJs are an important part of this composition, IMO. Very nice focus, saturation, and colour. Overall, a well done image.</td>', 'I don''t understand your title at all. I am guessing it means we are looking at the dreaming person? BUT, the PJs are very nice and your whole scene conveys an idea, which I really love. Her PJs are an important part of this composition, IMO. Very nice focus, saturation, and colour. Overall, a well done image.', '2008-10-01 18:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4985501, 725206, 98391, '<td valign="top">Very cool.</td>', 'Very cool.', '2008-10-01 18:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4985503, 726725, 70375, '<td valign="top">Coffee has 2 E''s :) I see where you are going with this. Nice idea but the execution is a wee bit lacking. Your onboard flash left a glare on the cup and the PJs. The lake scene is very flatly lit and out of focus. With this type of shot, you really need a higher f-stop. The PJs are not the main subject, the coffee cup and the lake are. If you do this shot again, try placing the camera on a tripod behind you, lay down more so more of the PJs can be captured, and try using a longer shutter speed and no flash.</td>', 'Coffee has 2 E''s :) I see where you are going with this. Nice idea but the execution is a wee bit lacking. Your onboard flash left a glare on the cup and the PJs. The lake scene is very flatly lit and out of focus. With this type of shot, you really need a higher f-stop. The PJs are not the main subject, the coffee cup and the lake are. If you do this shot again, try placing the camera on a tripod behind you, lay down more so more of the PJs can be captured, and try using a longer shutter speed and no flash.', '2008-10-01 18:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4985506, 724660, 70375, '<td valign="top">OH MY GOODNESS!! How in the world did you get that rose in that dog''s mouth? :) That is the cutest shot ever! I am not fond of the red backdrop, would like to see the white all the way over it... but, that is aesthetics. This is just too darn cute!</td>', 'OH MY GOODNESS!! How in the world did you get that rose in that dog''s mouth? :) That is the cutest shot ever! I am not fond of the red backdrop, would like to see the white all the way over it... but, that is aesthetics. This is just too darn cute!', '2008-10-01 19:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4985530, 726712, 70375, '<td valign="top">You did a great conversion here. I am not too fond of the huge border though. B&amp;W images usually don''t take a lot of size/space so go for filling up the allotted space with your image. The light on the child''s face is a little bit too dark, a reflective surface on this side would have remedied that. Her right shoulder is blending into the BG. I actually like the brightness back there behind her head though.</td>', 'You did a great conversion here. I am not too fond of the huge border though. B&W images usually don''t take a lot of size/space so go for filling up the allotted space with your image. The light on the child''s face is a little bit too dark, a reflective surface on this side would have remedied that. Her right shoulder is blending into the BG. I actually like the brightness back there behind her head though.', '2008-10-01 19:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4985539, 727061, 70375, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent idea and a great movie title image title too. This would have been wonderful if not so bright. You really need to find a way to dial down your flash if you are going to use it at this close range. You did a very nice job with the PJs, his eyes compliment them well.</td>', 'This is an excellent idea and a great movie title image title too. This would have been wonderful if not so bright. You really need to find a way to dial down your flash if you are going to use it at this close range. You did a very nice job with the PJs, his eyes compliment them well.', '2008-10-01 19:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4985545, 726723, 70375, '<td valign="top">I love your idea. There is just one thing that could make this image better for this particular challenge. Pan back a little and fill the frame with those gorgeous PJs. You have a lovely model and I only wish I had a horse to ride at 7am :) Good luck.</td>', 'I love your idea. There is just one thing that could make this image better for this particular challenge. Pan back a little and fill the frame with those gorgeous PJs. You have a lovely model and I only wish I had a horse to ride at 7am :) Good luck.', '2008-10-01 19:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4985554, 725370, 70375, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot. I would like to see the background, as it is right now, you are kind-of floating in space. Your WB is a little off (yellowish). Try balancing it to tungsten next time, it adds some blue (which would also make your PJs pop a little more). Your focus is good, light on your face is nice, and your pose is great. All-in-all, not too bad :)</td>', 'This is a nice shot. I would like to see the background, as it is right now, you are kind-of floating in space. Your WB is a little off (yellowish). Try balancing it to tungsten next time, it adds some blue (which would also make your PJs pop a little more). Your focus is good, light on your face is nice, and your pose is great. All-in-all, not too bad :)', '2008-10-01 19:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4985604, 726921, 77196, '<td valign="top">The colors clash - you''ve mixed a blue red (background, left) with an orange red, actual orange and sort-of yellow.</td>', 'The colors clash - you''ve mixed a blue red (background, left) with an orange red, actual orange and sort-of yellow.', '2008-10-01 19:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
