(4987102, 726699, 70375, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see the PJs in this shot. I''m thinking they might be the orangy things there in the middle? This shot has GREAT focus and beautiful light, it just looks really messy/cluttered. Example: There is something going across the top left corner, can''t even tell what it is; and there is something that looks like it might be a painting in the top right corner. I can''t give you any help here except to remind you that composition plays a huge roll.</td>', 'I don''t really see the PJs in this shot. I''m thinking they might be the orangy things there in the middle? This shot has GREAT focus and beautiful light, it just looks really messy/cluttered. Example: There is something going across the top left corner, can''t even tell what it is; and there is something that looks like it might be a painting in the top right corner. I can''t give you any help here except to remind you that composition plays a huge roll.', '2008-10-02 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987119, 726957, 70375, '<td valign="top">I like your idea. There are a few things that would have made your composition a bit stronger, the PJs lose center stage here because of the huge book covering them. Having the kids lay on their tummies with a vertical comp might have been better to show them. Your lighting is kinda flat. Meaning there is no difference between light and dark areas so your image lost depth. Focus is just a hair soft, try a bigger f-stop. Cute kids though and, like I said, a good idea.</td>', 'I like your idea. There are a few things that would have made your composition a bit stronger, the PJs lose center stage here because of the huge book covering them. Having the kids lay on their tummies with a vertical comp might have been better to show them. Your lighting is kinda flat. Meaning there is no difference between light and dark areas so your image lost depth. Focus is just a hair soft, try a bigger f-stop. Cute kids though and, like I said, a good idea.', '2008-10-02 13:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987121, 725086, 70375, '<td valign="top">My words escape me. This is way too small and I can''t find the PJs. You are allowed 640pixels on the longest side, my suggestion is to use it.</td>', 'My words escape me. This is way too small and I can''t find the PJs. You are allowed 640pixels on the longest side, my suggestion is to use it.', '2008-10-02 13:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987123, 725369, 70375, '<td valign="top">Your light is lovely. I think you could have increased the contrast even a hair more to get rid of the black totally though. Overall, a very peaceful image and very well lit with no blow-outs. Good luck :)</td>', 'Your light is lovely. I think you could have increased the contrast even a hair more to get rid of the black totally though. Overall, a very peaceful image and very well lit with no blow-outs. Good luck :)', '2008-10-02 13:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
