(4987418, 726632, 90651, '<td valign="top">10 - Best of Show - full of narrative plus great composition, lighting, color and DOF. Minor issues would be that those metal looking things in the background ruin the romantic possibility that this might be a family camping/dining deep in the woods. Also, the title focuses my thoughts on the feet/leg count and typography which I personally find uninteresting/annoying. I would have titled it either something boring stating the obvious "pajamas" or "dirty feet" or something that advances the narrative/humor like "camping with kids" or "feeding the birds".</td>', '10 - Best of Show - full of narrative plus great composition, lighting, color and DOF. Minor issues would be that those metal looking things in the background ruin the romantic possibility that this might be a family camping/dining deep in the woods. Also, the title focuses my thoughts on the feet/leg count and typography which I personally find uninteresting/annoying. I would have titled it either something boring stating the obvious "pajamas" or "dirty feet" or something that advances the narrative/humor like "camping with kids" or "feeding the birds".', '2008-10-02 15:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987611, 726835, 97954, '<td valign="top">Nice surreal quality to this!</td>', 'Nice surreal quality to this!', '2008-10-02 17:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987627, 727187, 97954, '<td valign="top">This would have been good for the catalog challenge but while good technically it doessn''t "draw me in" with anything to really focus on.</td>', 'This would have been good for the catalog challenge but while good technically it doessn''t "draw me in" with anything to really focus on.', '2008-10-02 17:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987630, 726877, 97954, '<td valign="top">Really like the highlit edge on the bear.</td>', 'Really like the highlit edge on the bear.', '2008-10-02 17:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987641, 726817, 97954, '<td valign="top">I think this could benefit from a little separation from the background as it''s kind of disconcerting to look like baby is floating in space. :)  The blue draws the eyes away from the focus which should be on the eyes.</td>', 'I think this could benefit from a little separation from the background as it''s kind of disconcerting to look like baby is floating in space. :)  The blue draws the eyes away from the focus which should be on the eyes.', '2008-10-02 17:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987649, 726994, 97954, '<td valign="top">Good concept, would have worked better with less "busy" pajamas.</td>', 'Good concept, would have worked better with less "busy" pajamas.', '2008-10-02 17:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987658, 726703, 97954, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would be cool on a cloudy stormy day and the pajamas with the fluffy clouds would be a nice effect. The tree draws the eyes out of the image.</td>', 'I think this shot would be cool on a cloudy stormy day and the pajamas with the fluffy clouds would be a nice effect. The tree draws the eyes out of the image.', '2008-10-02 17:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4987664, 726995, 97954, '<td valign="top">The cat''s eyes need to be more in focus and although cat''s rarely cooperate it would be nice to have the eyes focused on the camera.</td>', 'The cat''s eyes need to be more in focus and although cat''s rarely cooperate it would be nice to have the eyes focused on the camera.', '2008-10-02 17:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
