(4987870, 725444, 31535, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting it. If those are pajamas on the chair, they are not the focus of this shot. They are more secondary and not very distinguishable.</td>', 'I''m not getting it. If those are pajamas on the chair, they are not the focus of this shot. They are more secondary and not very distinguishable.', '2008-10-02 18:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
