(4989338, 725421, 70375, '<td valign="top">As cute as that is, I see no PJs. But, there are a few little things that could be improved upon anyway. Focus. It is not quite crisp. The bright spot on the wall (read: blow out top right). It is a distraction from the overall image. Your colours lack punch. Anyway, good luck!</td>', 'As cute as that is, I see no PJs. But, there are a few little things that could be improved upon anyway. Focus. It is not quite crisp. The bright spot on the wall (read: blow out top right). It is a distraction from the overall image. Your colours lack punch. Anyway, good luck!', '2008-10-03 10:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4989339, 726925, 70375, '<td valign="top">This shot really brings the PJs to center stage. I love your creativity with flash. There are muddy blacks at the back, but they don''t detract too much. This does look like a nightmare I would not like to have. He looks super creepy :)</td>', 'This shot really brings the PJs to center stage. I love your creativity with flash. There are muddy blacks at the back, but they don''t detract too much. This does look like a nightmare I would not like to have. He looks super creepy :)', '2008-10-03 10:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4989344, 726763, 70375, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. Bright star in the bottom left is a bit of a distraction, would have scored you higher had it been cropped out. Otherwise, this is perfect. Focus, colour, light, the way the stars fade out into blackness. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Nice macro. Bright star in the bottom left is a bit of a distraction, would have scored you higher had it been cropped out. Otherwise, this is perfect. Focus, colour, light, the way the stars fade out into blackness. Very nicely done.', '2008-10-03 10:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4989345, 726938, 70375, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2008-10-03 10:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4989364, 727007, 70375, '<td valign="top">Cute baby! :) The light in this photograph is very nice. I see only one MAJOR problem. Your focus is off. It is very very soft. Try using a faster shutter speed combined with a higher f-stop. Babies, as a general rule, need to be photographed at no less than 1/100s. Just because they move so fast.</td>', 'Cute baby! :) The light in this photograph is very nice. I see only one MAJOR problem. Your focus is off. It is very very soft. Try using a faster shutter speed combined with a higher f-stop. Babies, as a general rule, need to be photographed at no less than 1/100s. Just because they move so fast.', '2008-10-03 10:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4989375, 726774, 70375, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. Glad the PJs take center stage here. I would like to have seen a more dramatic lighting. It would have conveyed the mood a bit better. Also, a deeper DOF. Try using a higher f-stop so that the whole scene is in very sharp focus. Also, there is a little something in the top left corner. A bit distracting. Good luck :)</td>', 'Cute idea. Glad the PJs take center stage here. I would like to have seen a more dramatic lighting. It would have conveyed the mood a bit better. Also, a deeper DOF. Try using a higher f-stop so that the whole scene is in very sharp focus. Also, there is a little something in the top left corner. A bit distracting. Good luck :)', '2008-10-03 10:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4989380, 726735, 70375, '<td valign="top">This has an old film style. Very nice. I am not exactly sure those are PJs though... they look more like clothes you would wear to a club. Would like to see a bit more contrast in the lights and darks. Focus is great! Good luck :)</td>', 'This has an old film style. Very nice. I am not exactly sure those are PJs though... they look more like clothes you would wear to a club. Would like to see a bit more contrast in the lights and darks. Focus is great! Good luck :)', '2008-10-03 10:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4989381, 725613, 61818, '<td valign="top">You should be drawn and quartered for setting up such a shot and then lighting it so it''s damn near impossible to make out.  Grrrrrrrrr.</td>', 'You should be drawn and quartered for setting up such a shot and then lighting it so it''s damn near impossible to make out.  Grrrrrrrrr.', '2008-10-03 10:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4989384, 725913, 70375, '<td valign="top">Lovely macro. Lovely lighting. Your POF fell in a wonderful place. Fold at the bottom right hand corner is a bit distracting. Otherwise, good use of ROTs. Good luck :)</td>', 'Lovely macro. Lovely lighting. Your POF fell in a wonderful place. Fold at the bottom right hand corner is a bit distracting. Otherwise, good use of ROTs. Good luck :)', '2008-10-03 10:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4989389, 726835, 70375, '<td valign="top">Love the idea. Nice road! Id like to see a bit more light on your subject though, he is almost lost in the image. Good luck! :)</td>', 'Love the idea. Nice road! Id like to see a bit more light on your subject though, he is almost lost in the image. Good luck! :)', '2008-10-03 10:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4989397, 727129, 70375, '<td valign="top">This is way too small. You are allowed 640pixels on the longest side. Without the vignette, and a little bit of a bigger photo, this would have been awesome. That vignette really kills this. Makes it look dirty at the top. Adorable bear and nice PJs though.</td>', 'This is way too small. You are allowed 640pixels on the longest side. Without the vignette, and a little bit of a bigger photo, this would have been awesome. That vignette really kills this. Makes it look dirty at the top. Adorable bear and nice PJs though.', '2008-10-03 10:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4989402, 726877, 70375, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. I can''t quite put my finger on it, but the person almost looks out of focus, even though that is impossible because all of the grass and sand around them is perfectly IN focus. I like your use of flash to balance the scene, but I think this would have been even better without it. :-/ A gold reflector might have been better as it would have mirrored that lovely golden sunlight. Such decisions we have to make. Good luck! :)</td>', 'Very nicely done. I can''t quite put my finger on it, but the person almost looks out of focus, even though that is impossible because all of the grass and sand around them is perfectly IN focus. I like your use of flash to balance the scene, but I think this would have been even better without it. :-/ A gold reflector might have been better as it would have mirrored that lovely golden sunlight. Such decisions we have to make. Good luck! :)', '2008-10-03 10:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4989406, 727141, 70375, '<td valign="top">Too cute! The only thing that hurts this, IMO, (and I do mean the ONLY thing) is the crop. Shot in Portrait Orientation and showing more of the PJs on the legs would have made this MUCH stronger. BUT!!! Your focus and light are WONDERFUL. Good luck!! :)</td>', 'Too cute! The only thing that hurts this, IMO, (and I do mean the ONLY thing) is the crop. Shot in Portrait Orientation and showing more of the PJs on the legs would have made this MUCH stronger. BUT!!! Your focus and light are WONDERFUL. Good luck!! :)', '2008-10-03 10:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
