(4991409, 724894, 28359, '<td valign="top">I''m just going to give some tips that I think would improve this shot. The lighting is harsh infront appears used on board flash, maybe not flash, use nature light with the correct white balance. The composition is centered top to bottom, maybe go 1/3 down. The focus appears off, maybe just focusing on the face and let the rest a little blurred. Some of my opinion is processing and the other is equipment.....ace</td>', 'I''m just going to give some tips that I think would improve this shot. The lighting is harsh infront appears used on board flash, maybe not flash, use nature light with the correct white balance. The composition is centered top to bottom, maybe go 1/3 down. The focus appears off, maybe just focusing on the face and let the rest a little blurred. Some of my opinion is processing and the other is equipment.....ace', '2008-10-04 13:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
