(4996103, 726548, 91614, '<td valign="top">There were a lot of images like this one in the challenge, but i like this one the best. The diagonal is very strong visually. I only wish the cloud in the upper right wasn''t there. It''s a little distracting but there''s noting you can do about that in basic editing. Love the overall gradient of the sky. It was captured really nicely. Great colors. :) Hey did you ever consider rotating it 180 degrees? I kind of like it that way. But your perspecttive is great.</td>', 'There were a lot of images like this one in the challenge, but i like this one the best. The diagonal is very strong visually. I only wish the cloud in the upper right wasn''t there. It''s a little distracting but there''s noting you can do about that in basic editing. Love the overall gradient of the sky. It was captured really nicely. Great colors. :) Hey did you ever consider rotating it 180 degrees? I kind of like it that way. But your perspecttive is great.', '2008-10-06 23:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
