(4998375, 726876, 94601, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  First challenge entered for me, and I''ve come to realize that no one can read my mind!  The white "wall" behind the bear is actually a bathroom.  The story I had in my head was the bathroom light turning on and the teddy bear being angry with the lights on (and you know in the morning when the light turns on how it''s really bright and hurts your eyes).<br/> <br/>But the washing out of the bathroom light washed out the door knob and towel racks, which were the distinguishing factors of the bathroom (why I originally framed it the way I did).<br/> <br/>Good fun and good learning experience!<br/> <br/>Thanks for those that left comments... hopefully I can only go up from here!</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  First challenge entered for me, and I''ve come to realize that no one can read my mind!  The white "wall" behind the bear is actually a bathroom.  The story I had in my head was the bathroom light turning on and the teddy bear being angry with the lights on (and you know in the morning when the light turns on how it''s really bright and hurts your eyes). But the washing out of the bathroom light washed out the door knob and towel racks, which were the distinguishing factors of the bathroom (why I originally framed it the way I did). Good fun and good learning experience! Thanks for those that left comments... hopefully I can only go up from here!', '2008-10-08 02:50:39.000000', NULL, 0),
